{"id":"wb-3-90","name":"祥集弄民宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"祥集弄民宅","text":"祥集弄民宅位于中国江西省景德镇市珠山区珠山街道祥集上弄，其中3号、11号民宅于1988年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。 \n祥集上弄内有明代民宅多处，其中3号、11号建于明成化年间，结构布局相同，均坐东朝西。两宅均为木构架建筑，在东、西立封檐墙，南、北砌封火山墙，南厢开门，构架为五架穿斗式，带廊轩。3号民宅占地面积219.58平方米，建筑面积396.59平方米，11号民宅占地面积317.73平方米，建筑面积455.31平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A5%A5%E9%9B%86%E5%BC%84%E6%B0%91%E5%AE%85","revisionId":94151954,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94151954","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2bec184c107e9b195f9173c2.jpg","title":"Jingdezhen_Xiangjilong_Minzhai_2017.12.30_14-26-11.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jingdezhen_Xiangjilong_Minzhai_2017.12.30_14-26-11.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/Jingdezhen_Xiangjilong_Minzhai_2017.12.30_14-26-11.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"祥集弄民宅","width":320,"height":213}}